      "cooked": "<p>Challenge Apostate faces off against classic Dark Watch- Harpy, Nightmist, Setback, Expatriette and Mr. Fixer - in the Pike Industrial Complex.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/972a83bad94fb9f75f58ead001325fc6aba761fd.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/972a83bad94fb9f75f58ead001325fc6aba761fd\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/972a83bad94fb9f75f58ead001325fc6aba761fd_2_231x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"lzhbtsBo0gln0EFaTMFaPeWeOct\" width=\"231\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/972a83bad94fb9f75f58ead001325fc6aba761fd_2_231x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/972a83bad94fb9f75f58ead001325fc6aba761fd_2_346x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/972a83bad94fb9f75f58ead001325fc6aba761fd_2_462x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/972a83bad94fb9f75f58ead001325fc6aba761fd_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">828×1792 88 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>After heroes falling left, right and center the last few weeks, good to see that justice, truth and the Dark Watch way come out on top in this straightforward bash. The two mystical mavens were fairly low key this outing as the rest of the team showed there’s nothing that can’t be handled with a little luck, a shotgun and the liberal application of a crowbar.</p>",
