      "created_at": "2023-03-23T17:32:16.315Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Challenge Apostate only slows you down at the start, and as you said, everyone is set up quite well so missing out on a few card draws doesn’t hurt at all. I appreciated that Setback pulled his weight for once. There’s never a game where I think “I’m so glad Setback is on the team”, but in this case, he at least kept up with the other heroes.</p>\n<p>I did not get the reference though - what was it?</p>",
