      "id": 251680,
      "name": "",
      "username": "Thunderbird",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/ba8739/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2023-03-24T02:43:11.584Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Well, it looked bad at the start until I gave up drawing cards.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/c/cc4b848315a5d7edbde43afd9972be9e96fe6b86.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/cc4b848315a5d7edbde43afd9972be9e96fe6b86\" title=\"20230323220653_1\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/cc4b848315a5d7edbde43afd9972be9e96fe6b86_2_690x388.jpeg\" alt=\"20230323220653_1\" data-base62-sha1=\"t9hcnN0IZuxPA1AIe2knuFrRVEa\" width=\"690\" height=\"388\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/cc4b848315a5d7edbde43afd9972be9e96fe6b86_2_690x388.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/cc4b848315a5d7edbde43afd9972be9e96fe6b86_2_1035x582.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/cc4b848315a5d7edbde43afd9972be9e96fe6b86_2_1380x776.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/cc4b848315a5d7edbde43afd9972be9e96fe6b86_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">20230323220653_1</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×1080 372 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>Setback came in for an art appropriate finish with exactly 7 tokens! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slot_machine.png?v=12\" title=\":slot_machine:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slot_machine:\"> <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/fist_right.png?v=12\" title=\":fist_right:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":fist_right:\"> <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/app